  "summary_md": "**SparkLLM ([@SparkLLM](https://x.com/SparkLLM/status/2116424542348513620))** releases **DSpark** speculative-decoding drafts for Spark-X2.6-4B. A 624M draft proposes up to 7 tokens per pass for 2.14x average speedup on an RTX 4090 (llama.cpp) and 2.50x on an M5 Pro (MLX), peaking at 2.94x and 532 tok/s, with upstream llama.cpp support in progress ([XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-DSpark-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/XHToken/Spark-X2.6-4B-DSpark-GGUF)).",
